  "body": "In the process of working out the `.well-known`, it was brought up that the server validation step in that process should not be specific to just `.well-known`, and that it would be better discussed as its own (sub-)section.  This would allow it to be referred to by other ways of finding servers, and allow more room for explanation, rationale, etc.",
